    "customerStep1Desc": "Sign up in about 5 minutes. No credit card required.",
    "customerStep2Title": "Post a Job",
    "customerStep2Desc": "Describe what you need — handyman work, cleaning, yard work, moving help, and more. Set your budget and timeline.",
    "customerStep3Title": "Receive Bids",
    "customerStep3Desc": "Qualified local helpers see your job and send competitive bids. Compare profiles, ratings, and pricing side by side.",
